7:48-08:00","id":1350049,"title":"","content":"It is possible, auto-seal an own statement?<br /> For reap a beat for the promise, simple and clean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-26T02:00:24-08:00","id":1350996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Throne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1050476-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-changeling-edition?p=1350049#post1350049\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is possible, auto-seal an own statement?<br /> For reap a beat for the promise, simple and clean.</div> </div> </div> </div>AFB at the moment so I can't check the language of the rules for an exact interpretation on whether it is rules legal or not, but assuming there's nothing outright disallowing it I'd probably allow it. Of course, as stated, Wyrd <i>can</i> impose harsher penalties than the default when a seal is broken if there's certain circumstances involved (the example being making multiple promises that break one another when kept). Sealing your own statements would <i>certainly</i> be such a circumstance in my eyes. So if anything does happen to make it difficult or impossible to keep your promise (and as a ST I would, of course, milk this excellent source of drama and excitement and make sure this sort of thing happens <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) you might be looking at one big, whopping penalty as Wyrd's wrath comes crashing down on you. You were <i>so certain</i> of your word that you sealed your <i>own</i> promise, after all, how come you didn't keep it?<br /> <br /> So possible, perhaps, but &quot;simple and clean&quot;? No such thing when Wyrd gets involved! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Homebrew</b><br /> - CtL 2E: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1290961-additional-seeming-benefits-for-contracts-2e?p=1454478#post1454478\" target=\"_blank\">Seeming Benefits for every Contract</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1292-unahim","name":"Unahim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1292_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1080"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-27T08:46:41-08:00","id":1351293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Unahim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1050476-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-changeling-edition?p=1350996#post1350996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div cla